<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">LƆM - Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">LƆMÀ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan akà Alɔmà</para>
  <para style="toc2">LƆMÀ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lɔm</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan akà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Alɔmà</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbul ikikye ungö a nkweel anà ngwiiyà a Klistɔ, ikamɛnà naa Ayudà abà bàbulà aŋàlàkwikilà, asànaa Akilas anà Priska (Isal a Antööm 18.2), bàsɛmà mupay Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ u Lɔmà. Kyakin Ikööŋ atàtwɛb kyàkäl kya kwo, umpal kàlɔɔŋà Pɔl u Siri, u Azi Ikikye anà u Ngɛlɛsi. Nzam kun'pɛ buur mukyà « tii u ntsüü a mɛn ». Lalan kàkwen nde mukyà Lɔmà anà Ɛspanye. Ntɔn muyöŋà nkyeen ande, nde kàsön un'kaan aà kaŋàlàkwikilà a Lɔmà, « akà bɛ baar làbà u Lɔmà »</para>
  <para style="ip">Uboo a un'kaan ande, Pɔl akaswaŋà naa isal ande kyà ntööm a baar mpa abà Ayudà kyà aben, nde kan'tsülà abà: Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ là ngwal ufàsyääl Nzam ntɔn mutswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a baar banswà abye anà làkwikilà, Ayudà utàtwɛb, wee sye anà baar mpa abà Ayudà.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndaa a ilwaŋ a Ayudà anà baar mpa abà Ayudà, ntɔn muyöb naa nkääl a baar mpa abà Ayudà abà bàbulà aŋàlàkwikilà ikal aben kusà a un'kɔɔn a Ayudà, yàkäl ndaa a kölàköl utaaŋ a aŋàlàkwikilà bàtàtwɛb. Pɔl kàsön ya sye unsà in'kaan ande myumwɛy asànaa Ngalàtyà. Apà nde akyeyà u mbalà mwɛy naa Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ kàtwääl nde là ntɔn baar banswà ukɔɔn nsɔ̈ɔ̈l. Nde wàmubaal naa Nzam afàtswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbuur wanswà awà afàsà mpem akà Nde, itàkal naa nde wà nà.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Pɔl, un'syääl a Klistɔ Yɛsu, bun'bel mukal ntööm anà bun'si ukɔl ntɔn mukyään Làsaŋ a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Làsaŋ alà, nde kàtɛn itaan uboo a in'kaan in'kyɛɛl u mbwo a ŋangɔɔm ande. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Abun, ya yà ntɔn Mwan ande, bun'bör unsà ndür kà itoo a David, <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>bun'si Mwan a Nzam anà ngwal, u mbwo a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl, ntɔn ngwiiyà ande uboo a akü, Yɛsu Klistɔ, Mwol abi. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>U mbwo a nde, bi kàwɛl kab a ngway mukal ntööm ntɔn musyen, kà ikɔb ande, in'sɛŋ myanswà mpa amyà Ayudà mukun'kyey u mbwo a làkwikilà, <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>in'sɛŋ làbà bɛ sye uboo mwo, bɛ baar làwɛl làbeel a Yɛsu Klistɔ, <verse eid="ROM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>- akà atɔŋ banswà abà nkween a Nzam, u Lɔmà, abà bàwɛl làbeel a Nzam mukal bà in'kyɛɛl, wɛy bɛ làwɛl kab a ngway anà duu byan'fà akà Nzam awà Taaràbi anà akà Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɔl anà aklistɔ a Lɔmà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Mɛ in'tàkwen mufuur an'tɔɔn akà Nzam amɛ u mbwo a Yɛsu Klistɔ ntɔn bɛ banswà, ntɔn u mɛɛn manswà bàmutà imbäl a làkwikilà abɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Nzam awà in'fàsyääl mɛ unsà dweelà amɛ, u mbwo a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ a Mwan ande, nde wà mbäl amɛ naa mɛ in'fàlatà din taaŋ lanswà. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Taaŋ lanswà, unsà ngyamàkà amɛ, mɛ in'fàlɔm naa unsà ukwen a Nzam, mɛ in'mɛn ipɔ̈l aŋàbwaŋ muyà akà bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Unsà ya yanswà, mɛ iwe anà ngyal mukàlaman ntɔn mukàlapà kab a Dweelà ntɔn bɛ làkäl bàŋàtsim. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Itàkal naa u mbwo abɛ, bi banswà iwɛl ngwal, amwɛy anà bumwɛy, u mbwo a làkwikilà abi banswà, làbɛ asànaa làmɛ.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Atɔŋ, mɛ in'kwen anki mukalawɛy ukɔɔn ayöb naa mɛ in'fàkal anà an'kyän muyà akà bɛ, ntɔn muwal imbɛŋ imwɛy akà bɛ, asànaa akà in'sɛŋ myumwɛy mpa imyà Ayudà, wɛɛ tii apanà mɛ ipöl ŋàtàman anki. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Mɛ, mɛ in'we anà nkul a Angɛlɛki asànaa yà baar mpa abà Angɛlɛki, yà aŋan'yeerà asànaa yà insil. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Kyakin, mɛ in'we anà ngyal mukyään Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ akà bɛ sye baar làbà u Lɔmà.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngwal a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Ntɔn mɛ in'we anki anà nswɛn a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ, ntɔn la là ngwal a Nzam ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbuur awe anà làkwikilà, utàtwɛb akà Un'yudà, ungö akà Ungɛlɛki. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Ntɔn balàbal a Nzam làfàmɛnà u mbwo a la, unsà làkwikilà anà ntɔn làkwikilà, asànaa bàsön ya naa: « Mbuur awà balàbal unsà làkwikilà akyer asàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈. »<verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Man'be a baar mpa abà Ayudà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Apan sye, nkyɛl a Nzam ifàmɛnà fà du ntɔn mutɔn ukɔɔn inzaam anà nsaŋ a nkɔɔl a baar bàfàkaar ndandaa uboo a ntsüül a nsaŋ a nkɔɔl. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Ntɔn undiir ban'kwo muyöb akà Nzam, wa afàmɛnà ntɔn ba: Nzam kàkyamɛɛy wa. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Abun, fà kàkyer Nzam mɛɛn, nsyääl ande yàŋàsöön ubwaŋ yàŋàyee, ngwal a mbul a in'tye anà inzaam ande, byàkyer afàmɛnà ubwaŋàbwaŋ unsà un'yɛnà u mbwo a isal ande. Abun, baar un'lɔɔn bawɛɛl anki. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Ntɔn, itàkal naa ba bàyöb Nzam, ba nde làkoo bun'si anki asànaa Nzam, an'tɔɔn sye bun'fuur anki. Wɛɛ an'kyän aba màbulà màbunàbun, mpem aba yà unsil yàbilà uboo a làpib. <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Ba bàkyeyà uyɔl naa ba bà aŋayeerà, kyekà ba bàbulà aŋukɔŋ: <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>Ba bàsɔɔm làkoo a Nzam mpa afàsɔɔmà anà itɛk a mbuur afàsɔɔmà, anà itɛk a nɛn, anà ntsür a in'kɔl in'nà, anà ntsür yàfilaan.<verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Kyakin Nzam kawɛy nde naa mpem aba ikyer ukwen aba unsà mbiin, ntɔn ya ilwom làkoo a ndür aba ŋakwo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Ba bàsɔɔm ndandaa a Nzam asye a loor, ba bàpɛ làkoo anà bàsyäälà undiir bàkyer kà ikal a Nkyer awàŋàsaak, mbul a in'tye. Wöwö!<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Lalan, Nzam kasölà nde akà ilään a nswɛn: Akyay aba bàwɛy mukal anà abaal, ba bàbulà mukal ba a ba. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Abaal sye u mper yàba, bàpiy nkääl aŋàbwaŋ anà un'kaar, ba bàbilà unsà ilään a amwɛy anà bumwɛy, mukyer ndaa a nswɛn a baal anà baal, anà muwal unsà ndür aba, bweel a balàbal ntɔn ndiimà aba.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Asànaa mpa bàmɛn ba naa ndöŋ yatɛy muyöb Nzam, Nzam kasölà akà un'yɛnà aba akɔ̈ɔ̈n an'kyän aŋàbwaŋ: kyakin bàkyerà ba indiir mpa ban'kwo ba mukyer. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Ba bàŋàyɔl a un'kɔɔl aŋàyɔŋ wà ifà ifà, wà làmfɛɛl, wà ngyal a ngim, wà nkyɛl, wà un'köl, wà ndwää a baar, wà an'sye, wà impeenà, wà indiir a nswɛn, aŋambämà, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>aŋatwee, ayiiŋ a Nzam, aŋunkɔ̈ɔ̈n, aŋuyɔl, aswesweey, aŋun'yɛnà abɛ, aŋambɛɛy a aböör aba, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n un'yɛnà, bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n in'kɔɔn, bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n mpem a ukwen, bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n ngyɛb. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Itàkal naa ba bàkyàyɔ̈b ubwaŋàbwaŋ ntsüül a nsaŋ a Nzam ayitɛɛnà naa baar bàfàkyer indiir abi bàkyà ukwà, ba kà nà bàfàkyer bya mpɛl anki, ba bàfàkyey sye baar bàfàkyer bya.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Ntsüül a nsaŋ a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Abun, ngye, ngye un'lɔɔn bàsawɛɛl anki, ngye, itàkal naa ngye awà nà, ngye mbuur afàtsul mbar. Ntɔn, afàtsul ngye mbar a mbuur asin, ngye awàŋàkwɛlà ngye ŋakwo, ntɔn ngye afàkyer abun, ngye mbuur afàtsul mbar. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Kyekà, bi ikyàyöb naa ntsüül a nsaŋ a Nzam ifàkal unsà ndandaa ifàpà ngö akà baar bàfàkyer indiir abin. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Nkye ngye akasii, ngye mbuur afàtsul nsaŋ a baar ban'kyer anà afàkyer asànaa ba, naa ngye ayàkwɛlà anki u ntsüül a nsaŋ a Nzam? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Taaŋ lumwɛy ngye awàmudyà un'siinà un'naaŋ a ubwaŋ ande, nkääŋ a mpem anà un'kaay ande. Nkye ngye ayöb anki naa ubwaŋ abà bàmusiinà ngye u mbuul a mpem? <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Unsà mpem bwoor angye, unsà mpem angye mpa ikwen musɔɔmà, ngye awàmubel nkyɛl a kölàköl akà ngye ŋakwo, ntɔn ilä a nkyɛl a Nzam, ilä usàmɛɛy nde ntsüül a nsaŋ ande yà balàbal, <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>nde asàfuur mbuur mbuur asànaa akyà isal ande: <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye akà baar akwà, u mbwo a muküünà aba mukyer ubwaŋ anà muleŋ làkoo, ibyääl anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ mpa afàtay, <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>wɛɛ nkyɛl anà mfuunà a mpem akà ba akwà, ntɔn mutɔn uwem, bàfàlwomà u mbwo a ndandaa anà bàfàlab mbwo ikɔ̈ɔ̈n balàbal. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Ngyɛb mbɔɔn anà bɔɔmà mbɔɔn byàsàkal ntɔn mbuur afàkyer ube, utàtwɛb akà Un'yudà, ungö akà Ungɛlɛki. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Wɛɛ làkoo, ibyääl anà duu byàsàkal akà mbuur wanswà afàkyer ubwaŋ, utàtwɛb akà Un'yudà, ungö akà Ungɛlɛki, <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>ntɔn akà Nzam un'kɔɔl aŋàyɔŋ watɛy.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Baar banswà bàkyer man'be ukɔɔn un'kɔɔn, bàsàkwà sye ukɔɔn un'kɔɔn. Baar banswà bàkyer man'be uboo a un'kɔɔn bàsatsüül nsaŋ u mbwo a un'kɔɔn. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>La itàkal naa baar bàfàwem un'kɔɔn abà bàbalàbal kusà a Nzam, wɛɛ baar bàfàsyääl un'kɔɔn. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Isàkal naa baar mpa abà Ayudà, mpa bàyöb un'kɔɔn, abà bàfàkyer balàbal ndaa ufaswaŋ un'kɔɔn, un'kɔɔn awà amu ba ŋakwo, ba baar bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n un'kɔɔn. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Ba ban'swaŋ naa isal ukweenà un'kɔɔn kyàŋàsɔn u mpem aba, an'kyän aba màmutà imbäl sye, ntsüül a nsaŋ u mpem aba taaŋ làmwɛy ikyer afapɛl, taaŋ lumwɛy ikyer afawɛɛl. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Ndaa ayin yanwsà isàmɛnà u mii a mii, umpal usàtsul Nzam nkääl a baar yàŋàyee u mbwo a Yɛsu Klistɔ, asànaa awà ya unsà Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ in'fàlɔŋ mɛ.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayudà anà un'kɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Wɛɛ, ngye mbuur bàfabel Un'yudà, afàsà mpem angye unsà un'kɔɔn anà afàswaŋ ngaal ntɔn Nzam angye, <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>ngye akyàyöb ukwen ande, un'kɔɔn ande kàkyàlɔŋ naa ufàsɔɔl aben ndaa a mfun, ntɔn wa bàkyalɔŋ, <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>ngye mbuur an'sà kam naa ngye afàsyen ikwàmii, ngye awà pɛɛlà a baar abà uboo a làpib, <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>un'lɔɔŋ insil anà wà baar mpa abye anà ngyööb, ntɔn ngye ngyööb anà ndandaa an'wal uboo a un'kɔɔn ... <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Inye, ngye awɛy bää awà un'lɔɔŋ a baar asin, ntɔn nkye mpa alɔɔŋà ngye, ngye ŋakwo? Ngye afàlɔŋ naa bàkɔɔn ayib, ntɔn nkye ngye ŋakwo afàyib ngye? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Ngye afàtsuŋ baar mutà inswem, ntɔn nkye ngye ŋakwo afàtà ngye inswem? Ngye mbuur afàman itɛk ŋingyääy, wɛɛ ngye afàwal indiir a ngwal u ndwà a nzam aba! <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Ngye afàswaŋ ngaal angye ntɔn un'kɔɔn, wɛɛ ngye afàbɛy Nzam utaaŋ afàdwa ngye un'kɔɔn! <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Abun, ya yàŋàsɔn naa: « Ntɔn bɛ, ikɔb a Nzam kyàŋàbɛy akà in'sɛŋ asin. »<verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Ndandaa naa nkyɛɛy yà mfun isàkal naa ngye afàsyääl un'kɔɔn, wɛɛ, isàkal naa ngye afàbɛy un'kɔɔn anà nkyɛɛy, ngye, ngye awà asànaa mbuur mpa awàŋàkyɛy. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Isàkal naa mbuur mpa awàŋàkyɛy afàlab in'kɔɔn, nkye Nzam ayun'kyey anki asànaa nde wàŋàkyɛy, itàkal naa nde kà wàŋàkyɛy anki? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Abun, mbuur mpa awàŋàkyɛy u ndür ande usilabà un'kɔɔn, nde asatsüül nsaŋ, ngye mbuur awe anà un'kaan a un'kɔɔn anà nkyɛɛy, wɛɛ ngye afàbɛy un'kɔɔn. <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Ntɔn, kà ndaa ifàmɛnà u mii anki ifàkyer Un'yudà, itàkal idiim ifàmɛnà u ndür kyan'kyer nkyɛɛy, <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>wɛɛ ndaa aŋàyee ifàkyer Un'yudà, anà nkyɛɛy yà yà uboo a mpem, nkyɛɛy ifàfà amu Dweelà, kà kà un'kaan anki. Un'yudà a ndandaa awà, làkɔɔ ande afàwal anki akà baar, wɛɛ akà Nzam.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Abun, bweel nà Ayudà bye alà? Mfun a nkyɛɛy nkye? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Mfun yà unsà indiir mbɔɔn! Ntɔn Ndaa a Nzam bàtwab atàpa akà ba. - <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Ininà? Isàkal naa bàmbɔɔn uboo a ba bàkäl anki bàlää, nkye ukɔɔn lää aba alà làyàlwom lää a Nzam? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Kabwɛy anki! Wɛy Nzam bun'yöb naa nde wà ndandaa, mbuur wanswà wà mbuur a loor, asànaa bàsön ya naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">« Yubwaŋ bayöb naa ngye awà balàbal unsà ndaa angye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">naa ngye afàwal iböŋ isàkal naa bàmatsüül nsaŋ. »<verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Wɛɛ bi itɛn aben, isàkal naa un'kɔɔl aŋàyɔŋ abi afàsà balàbal a Nzam ukɔl? Nkye Nzam kà we anà un'kɔɔl aŋàyɔŋ anki kidwa nde unsà nkyɛl ande? Mɛ in'wàmutɛn unsà an'kyän a imbuur. <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Kabwɛy anki! Ntɔn abun, Nzam mɛɛn nsaŋ asun'tsüül aben?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Wɛɛ, isàkal naa u mbwo a loor amɛ, ndandaa a Nzam ifàpää mbɔɔn ntɔn làkoo ande, ntɔn nkye, mɛ, tii lalà ban'tsüülà ba nsaŋ asànaa mbuur un'be? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Abun, ntɔn nkye mpa ban'kwo mutɛn naa: « Wɛy bi ikyer ube ntɔn ubwaŋ bàtoo mwo »? Ntɔn baar amwɛy bàfibämà naa bi bàfàlɔŋ abwɛy. Baar aban ban'kwo muwal ntaaŋàmbar!<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuur a balàbal watɛy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Wɛɛ ininà? Bi Ayudà, bweel nà bi ifàkal alà? Akà ikikye! Ntɔn bi bàkyàtsul mbar naa baar banswà, Ayudà asànaa Angɛlɛki, bà ungyɛl a ikɔ̈b a man'be. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Asànaa bàsön ya naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">« Mbuur a balàbal watɛy, itàkal akà mwɛy,<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>akà mbuur a an'yeerà watɛy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:11">mbuur aleŋà Nzam watɛy.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Ba banswà bàkyàbwà ndwaŋ, bàkyàyöö.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">Akà mwɛy afàkyer ubwaŋ watɛy, itàkal akà mwɛy mpɛl.<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>Un'kwaal aba wà asànaa an'dii aŋàduub,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">làlem aba làfàkɔn loor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">an'te a ntäy mà ungyɛl a itɔ̈ɔ̈m aba.<verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>Mun aba wàŋàyɔl a in'küül anà buul.<verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>In'kɔl aba myà nswɛy mupay an'kil,<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>Ntɛɛl a upay anà ngyɛb yà u mbwo a ba,<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>anà mbwo a duu ba bàyöb anki.<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>Bɔɔmà a Nzam akà ikikye u mii a ba latɛy. »<verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Kyekà, bi bàkyàyöb naa ndaa yanswà kan'tɛn un'kɔɔn, wa kan'tɛn akà baar abà u ngyɛl a un'kɔɔn, ntɔn mun wanswà ukäl wàŋàbäm anà mɛɛn manswà màŋàkwàndwà u mii a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Wɛɛ, akà mbuur mwɛy usàmɛnà anki wàbalàbal kusà a nde u mbwo a isal a un'kɔɔn, ntɔn un'kɔɔn aswaŋà nà man'be mpɛl.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làkwikilà làfàpà balàbal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Wɛɛ apanà, u nsaay a un'kɔɔn, balàbal a Nzam làkyer amɛnà, un'kɔɔn anà aŋangɔɔm bun'tɛɛlà imbäl. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>La là balàbal a Nzam u mbwo a làkwikilà amu Yɛsu Klistɔ ntɔn baar banswà bàfun'kyey, ntɔn nsöön yatɛy: <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>ba banswà bàkyer man'be, anà batsüŋ làkoo a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Wɛɛ ba batwey bàngway balàbal u mbwo a kab a ngway ande ntɔn ntsuuŋà amu Yɛsu Klistɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Nzam nde kàpɛ asànaa ibɔɔn musɔŋ man'be a baar u mbwo a làkwikilà. Ibɔɔn aki iswaŋà balàbal a Nzam, mpa kàpɛ nde ntaaŋàmbar akà man'be bàkyer itaan, <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>utaaŋ a nkääŋ a mpem ande, ntɔn muswaŋ balàbal ande u taaŋ alà ntɔn nde ukäl wàbalàbal anà mutwey balàbal a mbuur kan'sà làkwikilà amu Klistɔ Yɛsu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Nkye apanà we anà undiir afàkyey uyɔl? Akà mwɛy watɛy! Ntɔn nkye? Unsà un'kɔɔn nà? Nkye wà isal? Ŋaa, wɛɛ kà un'kɔɔn a làkwikilà. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Bi bàkyàyöb naa mbuur afàtoo wàbalàbal u mbwo a làkwikilà, wɛɛ kà u mbwo a isal a un'kɔɔn anki. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Isàkal abwɛy, nkye Nzam wà Nzam a Ayudà mpɛl? Nkye Nde kà wà Nzam a in'sɛŋ myumwɛy anki? Ya yà ndandaa naa nde sye wà Nzam a in'sɛŋ myumwɛy, <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>ntɔn Nzam wà mwɛy: Nde asàtwey balàbal baar aŋàkyɛy u mbwo a làkwikilà, anà baar mpa abàŋàkyɛy u mbwo a làkwikilà. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Nkye apanà, ikaswaŋà naa u mbwo a làkwikilà bi kan'lwom un'kɔɔn? Ŋaa, bi kan'pà wa ngwal.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Abàlam ŋalàkwikilà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Abun, bi itɛn aben ntɔn nkaa abi Abàlam? Ininà nde kàwɛl unsà imbuur? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Isàkal naa Abàlam bun'twey balàbal u mbwo a isal ande, nde kàlàkal anà ngyal musɛn an'pɛy, wɛɛ kà kusà a Nzam anki. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Apan, Ndaa Aŋàsɔn itɛɛnà aben? Abàlam kàsi làkwikilà amu Nzam, kyakin Nzam kun'twey nde wàbalàbal. <verse eid="ROM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Kyekà, mbuur afàkyer isal mwɛy, làfur làŋàtɔɔl a lää, kà sànaa kab a ngway anki, wɛɛ asànaa nkul. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Isàkal naa mbuur ufàkyer anki isal, wɛɛ nde afàsà làkwikilà akà Mbuur afàtwey baar a man'be balàbal, làkwikilà ande làŋàsà un'tal unsà balàbal. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Kyakin David utɛɛnà nde ntɔn un'sak a mbuur kan'twey Nzam wàbalàbal mukɔɔn alab isal:<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>un'sak akà baar bàmadwääl nkul a an'kyän an'be aba, anà bàkyàfwe man'be aba!<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Un'sak akà mbuur mpa ufàsyeel Mwol un'tal a man'be ande!<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Nkye un'sak a kölàköl awà wà ntɔn bàŋàkyɛy mpɛl, lɛɛ wà sye ntɔn baar mpa abàŋàkyɛy? Kyakin, waa bi itɛn naa: làkwikilà a Abàlam bun'syel asànaa balàbal. <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>La bun'syeel taaŋ nà? Kusà lɛɛ ungö a nkyɛɛy ande? Ŋaa, kà ungö anki, wɛɛ kusà. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Ungö amukun'pà, ba bun'si isii a nkyɛɛy asànaa inyɛm a balàbal kàwɛl nde u mbwo a làkwikilà, utaaŋ kàkäl nde ŋàtun'kyɛy anki. Kyakin awà nde taa a baar banswà mpa abàŋàkyɛy, ntɔn ba sye bàbulà baar a balàbal, <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>anà taa a bàŋàkyɛy, a baar abà uboo a un'sɛŋ a bàŋàkyɛy mpɛl anki, wɛɛ baar ban'lab sye ntääm a làkwikilà a taaràbi Abàlam, kusà mukun'kyɛy.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làkwikilà anà ilää a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Kà ntɔn u mbwo a un'kɔɔn anki, wɛɛ u mbwo a balàbal a làkwikilà naa ilää awal kwal a mɛɛn bàpɛ Abàlam, itàkal itoo ande. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Isàkal naa kwal alà baar bàfàlab un'kɔɔn bàwal la, làkwikilà mfun làfàkal anki, ilää ifàkal anki. <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Ntɔn un'kɔɔn afàtwaal nkyɛl. Kyekà, kà ikal ikɔ̈ɔ̈n un'kɔɔn, mbɛɛy a un'kɔɔn sye yatɛy.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Kyakin, ikyee bàfàbulà u mbwo a làkwikilà, ntɔn ya ikäl u mbwo a kab a ngway, ntɔn ilää ikäl ntɔn itoo a Abàlam kyanswà, kà ntɔn baar bàfàlab un'kɔɔn mpɛl anki, wɛɛ sye baar bàfàlab làkwikilà a Abàlam, awà taaràbi banswà, <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>asànaa bàsön ya naa: « Mɛ kabuul taa a in'sɛŋ mbɔɔn. » Nde wà taaràbi kusà a mbuur kàsi nde làkwikilà, Nzam, afàpà akü mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà afàbel indiir mpa byàkäl akà ikikye asànaa bya byàkyàkal. <verse eid="ROM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Ukɔɔn asà an'kyän ande ukwɛl a làkyän lanswà, nde kàsi làkwikilà, waa kàbulà « taar a in'sɛŋ mbɔɔn » asànaa bàtɛn ya a nde naa: « Itoo angye isàkal mbɔɔn. » <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Nde kàkäl tsütsü mukɔlà mbul nkam, wɛɛ làkwikilà ande làkäl ka paa, itàkal naa ndür ande yàkäl yàŋàyɔɔn anà un'kyay ande Saal kàkäl ikɔb. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Ukɔɔn asà mpem bwoor akà ilää, nde kàsi ngwal unsà làkwikilà, waa kasi Nzam làkoo. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Ntɔn nde kàkyer ayöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa Nzam usàpà ilää, nde akyer afàkölà kya sye, nde we anà ngwal mukwey kya. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Kyakin bun'twey ba wàbalàbal. <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Kyekà, bàsön anki ntɔn nde mpɛl naa: « Nde bun'twey wàbalàbal. » <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>Wɛɛ ntɔn bi sye, bàsitwey bàbalàbal, bi baar ifàsà làkwikilà amu Nde awà kàwiiy Mwol abi Yɛsu uboo a akü. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Nde bàkyer un'kab ntɔn ibii abi, waa kàwiyà ntɔn mutwey bi bàbalàbal.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Mɔ̈ɔ̈ a duu anà Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Abà, bitwey ba bàbalàbal u mbwo a làkwikilà, bi ibà a duu anà Nzam u mbwo a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Amu nde, bi kan'wal mbwo u làkwikilà, unsà kab a ngway alà ifàkal bi aŋàtsim uboo a la anà ifàswaŋ bi ngaal unsà làkyän a làkoo a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Yumwɛy, bi ifàswaŋ ngaal itàkal uboo a ngyɛb aŋàdiir, bi ikyàyöb naa ngyɛb aŋàdiir ifàbɔr muküünà, <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>muküünà afàpà ntsim uboo a nsii, ntsim uboo a nsii ifàbɔr làkyän. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Kyekà, làkyän làfàkur anki, ntɔn ukwen a Nzam bàŋàyɔl u mpem abi u mbwo a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl awà bipɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Ntɔn, utaaŋ bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n bi ngwal, Klistɔ kàkü ntɔn baar a man'be, utaaŋ làkwe la. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Yà mpay naa mbuur ukü ntɔn mbuur a balàbal, taaŋ lumwɛy, yan'kwo ikäl naa mbuur mwɛy ukäl anà un'kanà mukyey ukwà ntɔn mbuur aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Wɛɛ Nzam afàswaŋ ukwen ande akà bi: Ntɔn, u taaŋ bàkäl bi baar a man'be, Klistɔ kàkü ntɔn bi. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Ntɔn apanà, bi bàkyitwey balàbal u mbwo a an'kil nde, abun, bi sye isàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈ u nkyɛl. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Kyakin, isàkal naa bi bàkäl ayiiŋ a Nzam, bi bàkyàbulà un'tüüb anà nde u mbwo a nkweel a Mwan ande, awà bi unsà un'tüüb, bi ikyer asàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈ u mbwo a mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Kà nà abwɛy mpɛl anki, bi bàfàswaŋ ngaal amu Nzam u mbwo a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ, u mbwo ande apanà, bi bàwɛl lɔ̈ɔ̈n.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adam anà Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Kyakin, asànaa u mbwo a mbuur mwɛy man'be màbilà u mɛɛn manswà, waa ube bàtwääl ukwà, waa ukwà bàbilà mbuur wanswà ntɔn baar banswà bàkyer man'be. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Ntɔn, fà nsɛmà tii un'kɔɔn, man'be màkäl u mɛɛn. Wɛɛ, ntaaŋàmbar yàkäl anki ntɔn man'be, un'kɔɔn kàkäl anki. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Kyekà, fà Adam tii akà Mɔsɛ, ukwà bàkyer akal, itàkal akà baar mpa bàkyer man'be, akɔ̈ɔ̈n ngweem asànaa mà Adam, ifà a mbuur awà ayàyà. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Wɛɛ, ye anà nsöön uboo a kab a ngway anà ibii. Ntɔn, isàkal naa u mbwo a man'be a mbuur mwɛy, bàmbɔɔn bàkyen ukwà, lalan sye, u mbwo a kab a ngway a Nzam, kab a ngway lan'fà akà mbuur mwɛy, Yɛsu Klistɔ, lan'söön ntɔn baar mbɔɔn. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Yumwɛy, kab a Nzam lan'lyaaŋ man'be a mbuur mwɛy u mfun: abà, u mbwo a man'be a mbuur mwɛy, ntsüül a nsaŋ yan'pà ntaaŋàmbar, kyekà, kab a ngway bàpɛ ungö a ibii mbɔɔn, lan'lwom ntaaŋàmbar. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa u mbwo a ibii a mbuur mwɛy, ukwà bàkyer ayaal, abun sye, u mbwo a Yɛsu Klistɔ mpɛl, baar bàfàwal kab a ngway mbɔɔn anà kab a balàbal, bàsàyaal u mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="ROM 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Abun, ntɔn ibii a mbuur mwɛy, mbuur wanswà kàwɛl ntaaŋàmbar, abun sye, isal a balàbal a mbuur mwɛy, kyà ntɔn baar banswà bàwɛl balàbal làfàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Abun sye, unsà ukɔɔn ngweem a mbuur mwɛy, baar mbɔɔn bàbulà baar a man'be, ifà imwɛy sye, unsà unkyeey a mbuur mwɛy, un'kàbɔ bàbulà bàbalàbal. <verse eid="ROM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Kyeka, un'kɔɔn kan'yà ntɔn ibii ibɛy, wɛɛ, kà ikal man'bilà man'be mbɔɔn, kab a ngway lan'sɔ̈ɔ̈nà. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Kyakin, asànaa man'be man'yaal ntɔn ukwà, apan u mbwo a balàbal, kab a ngway làyaal ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye u mbwo a Yɛsu Klistɔ, Mwol abi.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Ukwà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ amu Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Apanà, ininà bi itɛn? Nkye bi ikal tii kunà uboo a man'be ntɔn kab a ngway làsöönà? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Ŋaa! Bi kàkyàfuràkwà ntɔn man'be, bi iyàfàkal aben uboo a man'be? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Aben, bɛ lan'diimà naa bi banswà kàwɛl ndüümà amu Klistɔ Yɛsu, nkye unsà nkweel ande ayi, waa bi kàwɛl ndüümà? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Unsà ndüümà, bi bidyee u mbwo a nkweel ande mbwo mwɛy anà nde, ntɔn yà asànaa Klistɔ kàwiyà nde uboo a akü u mbwo a làkoo a Taa, bi sye iwal mɔ̈ɔ̈ akün.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa bi bàkäl un'tüüb unsà ukwà ande, bi sye isàkal anà wa u ngwiiyà ande. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Wɛy bi iyöb naa: imbuur itaan kàkäl bi akyà, bàkyàbɛɛrà u kulunsi anà Nde ntɔn mudwa ndür a man'be yi anà bi ikɔ̈ɔ̈n akal asɔ a man'be. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Ntɔn mbuur awà kan'kwà, nde bàmutwey balàbal unsà man'be. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Kyekà, ntɔn bi ban'kwà anà Klistɔ, bi ban'kyey naa bi isàkal sye u mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà Nde. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Ntɔn bi ikyàyöb naa Klistɔ awà kàwiyà uboo a akü, ufàsàkwà anki: ukwà bàfàkal anki anà ikɔ̈b udu a Nde. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Nde kàkü ntɔn man'be, mbalà mwɛy ipepey. Wɛɛ apanà, nde we anà mɔ̈ɔ̈, mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande wà ntɔn Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Abà sye bɛ, bɛ làmɛnà asànaa bɛ làkyàkwà unsà man'be, bɛ làwe anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ntɔn Nzam amu Klistɔ Yɛsu. <verse eid="ROM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Lalan, wɛy man'be màkɔ̈ɔ̈n akal anà ikɔ̈b udu a ndür abɛ yà ukwà ntɔn mufàkyey ilään a ya. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Twon lan'pà itiir a ndür abɛ akà man'be asànaa an'tà a indiir ikɔ̈ɔ̈n balàbal. Wɛɛ, làpɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ akà Nzam asànaa baar bàwiyà uboo a akü, waa abye anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. Lun'pɛ itiir a ndür abɛ asànaa an'tà a indiir a balàbal. Labilà unsà isal a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Ntɔn man'be màfàsàkal anki anà ikɔ̈b udu abɛ, ntɔn bɛ làfàkal anki ungyɛl a un'kɔɔn, wɛɛ ungyɛl a kab a ngway. <verse eid="ROM 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Ininà abun? Nkye bi ikyer man'be naa ntɔn bi bàfàkal anki ungyɛl a un'kɔɔn, wɛɛ ungyɛl a kab a ngway? Kà abwɛy anki! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Nkye bɛ làyöb anki naa kya bɛ làsàkal uboo a isal a mbuur asànaa asɔ ntɔn mukun'kyey, bɛ làbà asɔ a mbuur wa làkakyeyà bɛ wà? Itàkal isɔ a man'be ifàsyen kà ukwà, itàkal isɔ a nkyeey ifàsyen u balàbal? <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Wɛɛ bi bàfuur an'tɔɔn akà Nzam: kusà bɛ làkäl asɔ a man'be, wɛɛ apanà, bɛ làkyàkyey u mpem abɛ wanswà an'lɔɔŋ a kiin amà bàlapɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Abun, bɛ làkyàlwomà ungyɛl a man'be, waa lan'bulà asɔ a balàbal. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Mɛ in'tɛɛnà unsà imbuur, ntɔn bɛ sye làbà baar. Ntɔn, asànaa làpɛ bɛ itiir a ndür asànaa asɔ unsà isal a mbiin anà kyàlingyoomà abyà ifàsyɛn mutɔn Nzam, abun sye, làpɛ bya apanà ntɔn bya ibulà ungyɛl a isɔ a balàbal alà làfàsyen kà un'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="ROM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Umpal làkäl bɛ asɔ a man'be, bɛ làkäl nsaay kusà a balàbal. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Bɛ bweel nà làwɛl? Ŋàbawà bɛ làbà u nswɛn, ntɔn ntsüü a ma ukwà. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Wɛɛ apan bɛ làkyàlwomà ungyɛl a isɔ a man'be anà làkyàbulà asɔ a Nzam, bɛ lan'wal bweel làfasyɛn kà un'kyɛɛl, waa ntsüü a ya, yà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Ntɔn làfur a man'be là ukwà, wɛɛ kab a ngway a Nzam là mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye amu Mwol abi Klistɔ Yɛsu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Un'klistɔ anà un'kɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Atɔŋ, ikamɛnà naa bɛ lan'diimà - mɛ in'tɛɛnà a baar bàyöb un'kɔɔn - naa nkye bɛ làyöb anki naa un'kɔɔn afàkal anà ikɔ̈b udu a mbuur nà utaaŋ awà nde anà mɔ̈ɔ̈? <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Abun, un'kaar aŋàbääl wà un'tüüb, unsà un'kɔɔn, anà mbääl ande utaaŋ awà nde anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. Wɛɛ nde usàkwà, nde ufàfàkal anki ungyɛl a un'kɔɔn a bɔr. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Abà, isàkal naa nde kan'wal un'dim asin utaaŋ awà mbuur awà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈, nde kan'tà inswem. Wɛɛ, isàkal naa un'dim kan'kwà, nde kan'bulà nsaay kusà a un'kɔɔn, apan nde uyàkal anki ŋinswem mubulà un'kyay a mbuur asin. <verse eid="ROM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Abun sye ntɔn bɛ, atɔŋ amɛ, bɛ bàkyàlasà kà ukwà kusà a un'kɔɔn, u mbwo a ndür a Klistɔ, ntɔn mubulà baar a mbuur asin, Mbuur awà kàwiyà uboo a akü, ntɔn bi itwey mbɛŋ ntɔn Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Kyakin, utaaŋ kàkäl bi unsà in'twaŋ, ilään a man'be màfü unsà un'kɔɔn, màsyäälà itiir a ndür abi, ntɔn bi itwey mbɛŋ ntɔn ukwà. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Wɛɛ apanà, kàkü bi unsà ikɔ̈b kyàkäärà bi kà isɔ, bi kàkyàtoo nsaay kusà a un'kɔɔn. Ntɔn bi isäl ungyɛl a ikɔ̈b akün kyà Dweelà, wɛɛ kà ungyɛl a ikɔ̈b itaan kyà un'kɔɔn aŋàsɔn anki.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'kɔɔn anà man'be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Abun, ininà bi itɛn? Nkye un'kɔɔn wà man'be? Kà abwɛy anki! Wɛɛ, yàlàkal naa un'kɔɔn watɛy, mɛ man'be kàlàyöb anki. Abun, mɛ kàlàyöb anki ngyööm a mpem, yàlàkal naa un'kɔɔn kàtɛɛn anki naa: "Twon an'yɔm mpem." <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Mulab ndaa ayi, man'be màbör amu mɛ ngyööm a mpem yà ifà ifà u mbwo a nswɛɛŋ. Ntɔn, yàlàkal naa un'kɔɔn ukɔ̈ɔ̈n, man'be màlàkal undiir aŋàkwà. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Itaan, mpal kàkɔ̈ɔ̈n un'kɔɔn, mɛ kàkäl anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. Wɛɛ mpal yàyi nswɛɛŋ, man'be màfàwal mɔ̈ɔ̈, <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>mɛ waa kàkü: nswɛɛŋ yàlàsyeen u mɔ̈ɔ̈, yan'syeen kà ukwà. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Ntɔn man'be, u mbwo nsil ayin, laa man'kür ma, u mbwo a nswɛɛŋ, anà u mbwo a wa, waa kan'pɛ ukwà.<verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Abun, un'kɔɔn wà in'kyɛɛl, nswɛɛŋ yà in'kyɛɛl, balàbal anà ubwaŋ. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Apan, nkye undiir aŋàbwaŋ kàkyàtwaal ukwà ntɔn mɛ? Kà ndandaa anki! Wɛɛ mà man'be: ma màsyääl undiir aŋàbwaŋ mukan'pà ukwà, ntɔn wa kàmɛnà asànaa man'be anà muswaŋ nkyɛl a man'be, u mbwo a nswɛɛŋ.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuur anà man'be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Ndandaa, bi bàkyàyöb naa un'kɔɔn wà wàdweelà. Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ in'wà mbuur a un'sön a ndür, bàkyän'yälà u man'be asànaa un'sɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Ntɔn, mɛ in'fàyöb anki ayà in'fàkyer mɛ: mɛ in'fàkyer anki ayà in'fàkwen mɛ, wɛɛ mɛ in'fàkyer ndaa in'fàtɔn mɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Abun, isàkal naa ayà mpa in'fàkwen mɛ, mɛ in'fàkyer ya, mɛ an'kyey naa un'kɔɔn wà ubwaŋ. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Kà mɛ anki in'kyer abun, wɛɛ man'be amà amu mɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Ntɔn mɛ in'kyàyöb naa amu mɛ, - mɛ in'kwen mutɛn uboo a ndür amɛ - ubwaŋ batɛy: ukwen akyer ubwaŋ bàmwo, wɛɛ mɛ in'kakwo anki mukyer ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Kyakin ubwaŋ in'kwen mɛ mukyer, mɛ in'kyerà anki, wɛɛ ube mpa in'kwen mɛ, mɛ in'wàmukyer ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Kyekà, isàkal naa mɛ an'kyer ayà mpa in'kwen mɛ, kà mɛ anki an'kyer, wɛɛ man'be amà amu mɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Apan, mɛ an'man un'kɔɔn wà: mpal in'kwen mɛ mukyer ubwaŋ, ube bàmanääm. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>U mpem amɛ, mɛ in'fàman un'sak ntɔn un'kɔɔn a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Wɛɛ, uboo a itiir a ndür amɛ, mɛ an'fàman un'kɔɔn asin wàmunwan a un'kɔɔn a un'yɛnà amɛ, wa kàman'buul un'sɔ a un'kɔɔn a man'be amà uboo a itiir a ndür amɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Ngyɛb akà mɛ! Nà asan'tsuuŋ u ndür a ukwà yi? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>An'tɔɔn akà Nzam u mbwo a Yɛsu Klistɔ, Mwol abi! Mutsülà, mɛ ŋakwo in'wà un'sɔ a un'kɔɔn a Nzam unsà un'yɛnà, un'sɔ a un'kɔɔn a man'be unsà ndür.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà Dweelà a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Lalan, apanà, ikwàndwà ifàkal anki ntɔn baar abà amu Klistɔ Yɛsu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Ntɔn un'kɔɔn a Dweelà awafàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈ amu Klistɔ Yɛsu, kàman'tsuuŋ unsà un'kɔɔn a man'be anà ukwà. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Ntɔn undiir kàkäl mpay mukyer unsà un'kɔɔn, ntɔn un'sön kun'kwaamà ngwal, Nzam kàkyer akyer wa: ntɔn man'be, Nde kàtöm Mwan ande ŋakwo u ndür ayà asànaa ndür a man'be, nde kàpɛ ikwàndwà akà man'be unsà un'sön. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Kàkyer nde abà ntɔn balàbal alà kàlɔ̈ɔ̈mà un'kɔɔn làkwey amu bi, bi baar mpa ifàyikyà ungyɛl a ikɔ̈b a un'sön, wɛɛ unsà Dweelà. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Abun sye, ungyɛl a ikɔ̈b a un'sön, an'kyän aba màfàsyääl imbuur, wɛɛ baar abà ungyɛl a Dweelà, an'kyän aba màfàsyääl yin'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Ntɔn un'sön afàsyen kà ukwà, wɛɛ Dweelà afàsyen u mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà u duu. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Ntɔn an'kyän a un'sön màfàmbäär Nzam, ma màfàkal anki ungyɛl a un'kɔɔn a Nzam, ma màkwo anki akà ikikye. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Kyekà, baar bàfàkal ungyɛl a ikɔ̈b a un'sön, ba bàkwe anki mupà Nzam un'sak.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Wɛɛ akà bɛ, bɛ làbà anki unsà un'sön, wɛɛ unsà Dweelà, isàkal naa ndandaa Dweelà a Nzam wà anà bɛ. Isàkal naa mbuur watɛy anà Dweelà a Klistɔ, nde kà wà mbuur ande anki. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Abun, isàkal naa Klistɔ wà amu bɛ, ndür abɛ, ndandaa, yà ndür aŋàkwà ntɔn man'be, wɛɛ Dweelà wà mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ ntɔn balàbal. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Isàkal naa Dweelà a Nzam awà kàwiiy Yɛsu uboo a akü wà uboo a bɛ, mbuur awà kàwiiy Yɛsu Klistɔ uboo a akü asàpà sye mɔ̈ɔ̈ u ndür abɛ yà ukwà yi, u mbwo a Dweelà ande alà uboo a bɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Abun, atɔŋ amɛ, bi ibye anà nkul, wɛɛ kà yà un'sön anki ntɔn mukal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a imbuur. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa bɛ làbà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ unsà imbuur, bɛ làkyer asàkwà, wɛɛ isàkal naa unsà Dweelà, bɛ lan'dwa nkääl abɛ yà imbuur, apan bɛ làsàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Kyakin, baar abà bàfasyeen unsà Dweelà a Nzam, ba bà baan a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Ntɔn bɛ làwɛl anki dweelà làmwɛy lan'kwo mubuul bɛ asɔ anà mukàlapà bɔɔmà, wɛɛ Dweelà mwɛy afàlabuul bàŋàywaaŋ nkà, waa anà bi ikuub in'kwɛŋ: « Wɔɔ Taa! » <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Dweelà nde ŋakwo afàtà imbäl akà dweelà abi naa bi ibà baan a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Abun, ntɔn bi ibà baan, bi sye ibà akyee a kwal: akyee a Nzam anà akyee a kwal mbwo mwɛy anà Klistɔ, ntɔn bi ban'wal yar unsà mpay ande, bi sye isàwal yar unsà làkoo ande.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làkɔɔ làyàyà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Mɛ in'yweerà naa mpay a taaŋ alà ikwo anki anà làkoo alà làyàmɛnà amu bi. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Ntɔn, nkyeer yanswà yàmudilà anà nkääŋ a mpem mɛɛy a baan a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Ntɔn, nkyeer yanswà yàŋàbilà ungyɛl a ikɔ̈b a bunàbun, kà unsà ukwen aya anki, wɛɛ unsà ukwen a mbuur kàsi ya, wɛɛ làkyän làmwo: <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>ntɔn ya sye iyàfàkal anki kà isɔ a küüb ntɔn muwal yar a nsaay anà làkoo a baan a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Abun, bi ikyàyöb naa nkyeer yanswà tii lalà yà unsà mpay asànaa usaay a bɔr. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Kà ntɔn ya mpɛl anki: bi sye, bi baar ibye anà mbɛŋ atàtwɛb yà Dweelà, bi ibàmulaal u mpem abi, mudilà ngywaaŋ a nkà, ntsüüŋ a ndür abi. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Ntɔn bi kàkyàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈, wɛɛ ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈ ya yà unsà làkyän mpɛl. Abun, làkyän imanà bi là la kà làkyän anki. Kyekà, uman undiir bàsyeelà làkyän ifàkal nsyeel a làkyän anki: làkyän bàfàsà aben unsà undiir akamɛnà? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Wɛɛ usà làkyän unsà undiir mpa ikamanà bi, yà mudil wa unsà muküünà. <verse eid="ROM 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Ifà imwɛy sye, Dweelà làfàyà mukibay unsà gyɔ̈ɔ̈là abi, ntɔn bi iyöb anki muyamà ubwaŋàbwaŋ, wɛɛ Dweelà ŋakwo afàyamà ntɔn bi mulaal unsà ngɔk mpa ukwo mbuur mutwey. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Waa mbuur awà afàleŋ muyöb mpem akyàyöb an'kyän a Dweelà, ntɔn Dweelà afàyamà ntɔn baar in'kyɛɛl asànaa ukwen Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Bi ikyàyöb sye naa indiir byanswà byàfàlyaaŋ ntɔn ubwaŋ a baar bàkwen Nzam, anà baar kàbel nde ntɔn nswaal ande. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Ntɔn, baar abà kàyöb nde kusà, nde ba sye katsüül mukal bàbalàbal kà isii a Mwan ande, ntɔn naa nde awà ukäl nswɛm uboo a atɔŋ mbɔɔn. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Baar abà kàlɔ̈ɔ̈n nde fà itaan, nde kàkyer abel sye, baar kàbel nde, nde ba kabuul bàbalàbal sye, anà ba akwà kàbuul nde bàbalàbal, nde kàkyer asyäŋà sye. <verse eid="ROM 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Abun, ininà bi ifàtɛn ntɔn indiir abi? Isàkal naa Nzam wà anà bi, nà asimbäär? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Abun, nde mbuur mpa kàtii Mwan ande ŋakwo, wɛɛ nde kun'käb ntɔn bi banswà, ntɔn nkye mpa kipà nde, mbwo mwɛy anà Mwan ande, indiir byanswà? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Nà kan'kwo mufüün baar abà kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l Nzam? Nzam afàtwey baar balàbal! <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Nà asatsüül mbar? Klistɔ Yɛsu kàkyàkwà, waa kàfàwiyà, nde wà u kɔɔ a ibaal a Nzam, wàmubɔɔn ntɔn bi! <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Nà asàkaab bi anà ukwen a Klistɔ? Lingyoomà, ngyɛb, nkwaaŋ, ngyal, làmbwà, kɔm itàkal igɔnsà? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Asànaa bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">« Ntɔn ngye, bi bàkidwa ilä aŋukiinà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">ba bàfiwal asànaa ntsür bàfàsyen kà idwääl. »<verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Wɛɛ unsà ayi yanswà, bi ibà aŋàböŋ aŋàsöönà u mbwo a mbuur awà kikwen. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Ɛɛ, ndandaa mɛ an'sà kam naa itàkal ukwà, itàkal mɔ̈ɔ̈, itàkal akyeey, itàkal amfum, itàkal papanà, itàkal taaŋ làsàyà, itàkal ngwal, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>itàkal ngwal a du, itàkal ngwal a ngyɛl a mɛɛn, itàkal nkyeer asin, undiir mwɛy tɛy akaab bi anà ukwen a Nzam bàyàmɛnà amu Klistɔ Yɛsu awà Mwol abi.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Nzam anà un'sɛŋ kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Amu Klistɔ mɛ in'tɛn ndandaa, mɛ in'kur anki, u mbwo a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl, an'kyän amɛ man'tɛɛlà imbäl: <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>u mpem amɛ, mɛ in'we anà ngyɛb mbɔɔn anà usaay mpa bàfàtsü. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Ɛɛ, mɛ in'yàkwen naa ban'si in'küül, mɛ ŋakwo in'kaabà anà Klistɔ ntɔn atɔŋ amɛ, itoo amɛ u ndür. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Ba bà baar a Isàlɛl, abà unsà ngywaaŋ a nkà, làkoo, nkwà, nkɔ̈ɔ̈n, ngyamàkà, ilää <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>anà bàtaa, amu ba, unsà ndür, kàtoo Klistɔ awà udu a ya yanswà, Nzam aŋàsaak ipepey. Yà abwɛy!<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Ya ikaswaŋà anki naa Ndaa a Nzam iböŋ anki. Ntɔn, baar banswà abà akyee a Isàlɛl kà Bà Isàlɛl anki, <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>anà, kà akyee a Abàlam banswà anki abà baan ande, ntɔn Nzam kàtɛn a Abàlam naa: « Ngye akyee asàwal u mbwo a Isak. » <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Ikaswaŋà naa: kà baan a ndür anki unsà imbuur abà baan a Nzam. Baan a Nzam bà baan abà kàbɔ̈r nde uboo ilää kun'pɛ nde. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Ntɔn, ndaa ayi yàkäl ilää: « Mɛ in'kyer asàyàfurà u paŋà atub alà, Saal asàkal anà mwan baal. »<verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Kà yàtsü apan anki, Lɛbɛk sye kàbör baan a mbuur mwɛy mpɛl, Isak, taaràbi. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Apan, baan bàkäl anki bàŋàtàbɔr anà bàŋàtàkyer anki itàkal ubwaŋ, itàkal ube, ntɔn nswaal a Nzam ikwe, ndaa yàkäl kusà a nsɔ̈ɔ̈l kàkyer nde <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>mukɔɔn alab isal a baar, wɛɛ ukwen a mbuur kabel, waa kàtɛn a Lɛbɛk naa: "Bwel asàsyääl un'kɔm", <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>asànaa bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:13">"Mɛ kàkwen Yakɔb, anà kàyiiŋ Isawu." <verse eid="ROM 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Ininà bi itɛn? Nkye balàbal latɛy amu Nzam? Kà ndandaa anki! »<verse eid="ROM 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Ntɔn nde kàtɛn a Mɔsɛ naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">"Mɛ in'sàsyääm mbuur an'kwen mɛ musyääm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">anà in'sàpà kab a ngway akà mbuur an'kwen mɛ mupà kab a ngway. <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Abun, ndaa ayi ifàkal anki ntɔn ukwen itàkal ngwal a mbuur, wɛɛ u nsyääm a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Kyakin Ndaa Aŋàsɔn yàtɛn ya a Falawɔ naa: « Le, mɛ kasi mɛ mfum ntɔn muswaŋ amu ngye ngwal amɛ, ntɔn naa ikɔb amɛ bàkyään kya u mɛɛn manswà. » <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Abun, nde afàsyääm mbuur ukwen nde, afàsà mpem bwoor akà mbuur ukwen nde.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkyɛl anà ngyɛb a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Wɛɛ abun, ngye ayàtɛn a mɛ naa: « Ntɔn nkye ufiŋään nde, ntɔn, akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki mumbäär ukwen ande? » <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Wɛɛ ngye awà nà, mbuur, ntɔn musà Nzam mbaaŋ? Nkye làbuuŋ lan'kwo làtɛn a un'boom ande naa: « Ntɔn nkye kan'kyer ngye abà? » <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Un'boom, kà wà mfum a tɔm ande anki mukyer a twar nsil alan, làbuuŋ a ibyääl, itàkal làbuuŋ a isal a bunàbun?<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Ngye ininà atɛn, isàkal naa Nzam akwen mutwey nkyɛl ande anà muswaŋ ngwal ande, nde kàkyer asɛn buur anà nkääŋ a mpem mbɔɔn an'buuŋ a nkyɛl balɔ̈ɔ̈n ntɔn ukwà, <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>ayi yà ntɔn nde mumɛɛy un'naaŋ a làkoo ande akà an'buuŋ a un'naaŋ ande kusà a an'buuŋ a nsyääm kàlɔ̈ɔ̈n nde kusà ntɔn làkoo. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Bi ibà baar kàbel nde, kà nà uboo Ayudà mpɛl anki, wɛɛ sye uboo a baar mpa abà Ayudà. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Asànaa, un'kaan a Ɔzɛ utɛɛnà wa naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Awà mpa kàkäl un'sɛŋ amɛ, mɛ in'sun'beelà un'sɛŋ amɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">awà mpa kàkäl nkween amɛ, mɛ in'sun'beelà nkwen amɛ.<verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Ikal akyä bàtɛɛnà a ba naa: « Bɛ kà làbà un'sɛŋ amɛ anki »,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">ba bàsabeelà baan a Nzam a mɔ̈ɔ̈.<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Yɛsay, u mper yànde, kàsi un'kwɛŋ ntɔn Isàlɛl: « Itàkal naa baan a Isàlɛl bàkäl asànaa ansɛŋ a ngyäl a kölàköl, baar ikikye bàsàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="ROM 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Ntɔn Mwol asàkwey Ndaa ande yanswà làgyägyä u mɛɛn. » <verse eid="ROM 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Yɛsay awà kàtàtà ngɔɔm kusà naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">« Isàkal naa Mwol a aŋità kàsiwɛy anki ikyee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">abà bi kàkyàbulà asànaa Sɔdɔm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">bi kàlàkal balàbal asànaa Gɔmɔr. »<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isàlɛl anà ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Apanà, ininà bi ifàtɛn? Ayi: baar mpa abà Ayudà, mpa bàleŋà mubulà bàbalàbal, bàkyàwal balàbal lan'fà u làkwikilà, <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>kyekà Isàlɛl awà kàleŋà un'kɔɔn ntɔn mubulà balàbal, kàsàman anki la. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Ntɔn nkye? Ntɔn balàbal alà ba la bàyadilà anki unsà làkwikilà, wɛɛ ba bàsii naa ba la bàsawal unsà isal. Ba bàyàböl akà « un'kul awà afàbwiy », <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>abun, bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">« Le, mɛ kan'tɔɔl u Siyɔnà un'kul afàbwiy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">nkɔŋ ifàbwiy.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Wɛɛ mbuur afàsà làkwikilà amu Nde usàman anki nswɛn. »<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Atɔŋ, un'lään awà u mpem amɛ anà ngyamàkà amɛ akà Nzam ntɔn ba, yà naa ba bàwü mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Ntɔn, mɛ in'wà mbäl, ba bye anà uyɔl akà Nzam, wɛɛ kà uyɔl abàkapaa pɛɛlà anki u ngyööb. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Mudiimà balàbal làfàfà akà Nzam anà muleŋ musà là ba ŋakwo, ba bàfàkal anki ungyɛl a balàbal a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Ntɔn ntsüü a un'kɔɔn yà Klistɔ, ntɔn bàpɛ balàbal akà mbuur wanswà awe anà làkwikilà.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɔ̈ɔ̈ wà ntɔn mbuur wanswà kan'kyey Mwol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Nde ŋakwo Mɔsɛ kàsön ntɔn balàbal lan'fà akà un'kɔɔn naa: « Mbuur asàkwey nswɛɛŋ ayi, asàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ u mbwo a ya. » <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Wɛɛ, balàbal làfàfà unsà làkwikilà làtɛn abà: « Twon an'tɛn u mpem angye naa: "Nà asàbeenà du?" » Apɛy yà mutyeey Klistɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Itàkal naa: « Nà asàtyà kà un'baan? Nkye apɛy yà mumbaar Klistɔ uboo a akü? » <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Wɛɛ wa atɛɛnà aben? « Tsütsü apà ngye, yà ndaa, u mun anà u mpem angye. » Ndaa ayi, yà ndaa a làkwikilà alà ipay bi làsaŋ. <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Isàkal naa u mun angye, ngye afàtà imbäl naa Yɛsu wà Mwol, isàkal naa u mpem angye, ngye awe anà làkwikilà naa Nzam kun'wiiy kà ukwà, ngye asàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Kyakin, làkwikilà làfàbuul baar balàbal làfàfà u mpem, anà imbäl aki ifàwiiy baar mɔ̈ɔ̈ ifàtoo u mun. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Ntɔn, Ndaa Aŋàsɔn itɛɛnà naa: « Mbuur usàsà làkwikilà amu Nde, bàsun'mɛɛy anki nswɛn. » <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Abun, nsöön yatɛy uboo Ayudà anà Angɛlɛki: ba banswà bà Mwol mwɛy, awà afàpà indiir ande akà baar banswà bàfun'bel. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Abun, mbuur asàbel ikɔb a Mwol akyer asàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈.<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Wɛɛ, ba bàyun'bel aben isàkal naa làkwikilà amu nde latɛy? Ba làkwikilà bàyàsà aben amu nde, isàkal naa ba bàŋàtun'wem anki? Ba bàyun'wem aben isàkal naa mbuur ŋàtalɔŋ anki? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Wɛɛ ba bàyàlɔŋ aben, isàkal naa ba batöm anki? Yumwɛy bàsön ayi: « Myà ubwaŋ in'kɔl a baar abà bàfàpay Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ! » <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Wɛɛ ba banswà bàkyey anki Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ alà. <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Abun, làkwikilà làfàyà unsà ndaa bàfàwem, ngweem ifàfà u mbwo a Ndaa a Klistɔ.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Apan, mɛ in'fuul naa: Nkye ba bàwem anki? Ɛɛ, bàkyàwem! Ntɔn, bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">« Làböl aba làpää u mɛɛn manswà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">ndaa aba yàtöl tii u ntsüü a mɛɛn. »<verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Abun, mɛ in'fuul naa: Aben, baar a Isàlɛl bàyöb anki? Utàtwɛb Mɔsɛ kàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">« Mɛ in'yàsɛɛn un'kɔ̈l abɛ akà undiir mpa awà un'sɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">mɛ in'yàmbaar nkyɛl abɛ akà un'sɛŋ akɔ̈ɔ̈n un'yɛnà. »<verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Yɛsay kan'kyà kwɛl mutɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">« Mɛ bàmàkan'man akà baar mpa bàyan'leŋà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">mɛ kàkàmɛɛy akà baar mpa ban'lɔ̈ɔ̈mà akà undiir mwɛy. »<verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Wɛɛ ntɔn Isàlɛl, Nde kàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">« Ilä aŋukiinà mɛ an'lɛɛ an'kɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">akà un'sɛŋ aŋunkwem anà wàŋun'tswe ngwal. »<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Nzam kàpiy anki Isàlɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Abun, mɛ in'fuul naa: Nkye Nzam kàpiy un'sɛŋ ande? Akà ikikye! Ntɔn mɛ ŋàkwo iwà un'nsi Isàlɛl, itoo a Abàlam, uboo a ywar a Bɛnsàmɛn. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Nzam kàpiy anki baar ande kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l nde itaan. Imɛnà naa bɛ làkayöbà anki naa Ndaa Aŋàsɔn nkye itɛɛnà, u mbwo aya kàsi Elya tär ntɔn Isàlɛl a Nzam: <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>« Mwol, ba bàkyer adwa aŋangɔɔm angye, bàpay mɛsà a ibɔɔn angye, mɛ kàsàsal mɛ mpɛl, anà ba bàkwen mukan'dwa sye! » <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Wɛɛ, Nzam kàmun'fuur aben? « Mɛ kàyee ntɔn mɛ baar nsaab nsàmbwar yà abaal, baar mpa bàsàbwà kà an'bwaŋ kusà a Baal. » <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Yà balàbal utaaŋ alà, ban'saal baar ikikye kan'sɔɔl Nzam unsà kab a ngway ande. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Wɛɛ, isàkal naa unsà kab a ngway, kà unsà isal anki, iswaŋà naa kab a ngway kà là kab a ngway anki.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Apanà, bi ifàtɛn aben? Undiir ulɛŋà Isàlɛl, nde wa ŋàtàkaar anki, wɛɛ baar bàsɔ̈ɔ̈l bàkyer akaar wa, wɛɛ akà bumwɛy, mpem aba yàbulà bwoor, <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>asànaa bàsön ya naa: « Nzam kàpɛ dweelà a bɔɔmà, mii ntɔn ukɔɔn aman, an'tsü ntɔn ukɔɔn awem, tii ŋàbà. » <verse eid="ROM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>David waa kàtɛn sye naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">« Wɛy mɛsà aba ibulà untaam anà an'tɛy ntɔn ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">ntɔn mbwaeel anà ntaaŋàmbar ntɔn ba!<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Wɛy mii aba ibü mpib, tii mpal bàyàfàman ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">Abɔ̈ɔ̈là müm ipepey. »<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Waa mɛ in'fuulà naa: nkye ntɔn mbweel ipepey, waa ba bàsɛlà? Kà ndandaa anki! Wɛɛ ntɔn ibii aba, waa Nzam kàpɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ akà baar mpa abà Ayudà, ntɔn musɛn un'köl a Isàlɛl. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Kyekà, isàkal naa ibii aba byàpɛ un'naaŋ u mɛɛn, anà ntyeey aba un'naaŋ a baar mpa abà Ayudà, abun nsuub aba yàŋàkwo iyàtwaal un'naaŋ a nkye ifà? <verse eid="ROM 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Mɛ amàlakyään, ntɔn bɛ baar mpa làbà Ayudà: in'wà mɛ paa, mɛ, ntööm a baar mpa abà Ayudà, mɛ in'fàpà làkoo kà isal amɛ <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>unsà làkyän musɛn un'köl. Mɛ in'sii naa mɛ in'yàsɛɛn un'köl a atɔŋ amɛ unsà ndür ntɔn mutswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a ndam a baar uboo a ba. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa nsyeel a ba ukɔl yàfuur un'tüüb a Nzam anà mɛɛn, mfurà aba iyàkal aben? Ya isàkal asànaa mfurà a baar fà ukwà tii u mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="ROM 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Kyekà, isàkal naa kab atàtwɛb là in'kyɛɛl, mfwar yanswà iyàkal in'kyɛɛl, isàkal naa un'swɛy wà in'kyɛɛl, an'kɔkà màyàkal mà in'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Wɛɛ isàkal naa an'kɔkà mamwɛy bàkyàtsuul, wɛɛ ngye, un'te a ɔlive a ndwaŋ, ngye bakön uboo a an'kɔkà màsàsal kà un'te a ɔlivɛ ntɔn badii anà ma u mbwo a un'swɛy mwɛy anà u mbwo a inɔ̈ mwɛy kya, <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>twon an'swaŋ ngaal kusà a an'kɔkà amàŋàtsul. Ngye an'kwo aswɛŋ ngaal, wɛɛ kà ngye anki asɛɛnà un'swɛy, wɛɛ un'swɛy akasɛɛnà.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Apan, ngye ayàtɛn naa: « An'kɔkà bàtsül ma ntɔn mɛ ban'kön. » <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Ye abwɛy. Bàtsül ba ma ntɔn bwoor a mpem a ba. Wɛɛ ngye, unsà làkwikilà waa ngye awà paa. Twon an'sɛn an'pɛy, wɛɛ kal kà igyɛɛŋ. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa Nzam kàtii anki an'kɔkà màfàtoo ma ŋakwo, kal kà igyɛɛŋ, manà nde ukɔ̈ɔ̈n asatii, akà ikikye! <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Ler ubwaŋ anà nsyeel a mii a Nzam: nsyeel a mii akà baar abà bàbü, ubwaŋ akà ngye, isàkal naa ngye awà mulalà uboo a ubwaŋ ba, naa tɛy, ngye sye bàkyer asalwom. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Wɛɛ akà ba, isàkal naa ba ban'wɛy bwoor a mpem aba, ba bàkyer asakɔn, ba sye, ntɔn Nzam we anà ikɔ̈b mukakɔn mbalà asin. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Abun, isàkal naa ngye, ngye kàlwomà unsà un'te a olivɛ a ndwaŋ awà katwey wa ŋakwo, waa bakön unsà un'te a ɔlive a boo a bul, itàkal naa kà wa anki katwey, ntɔn nkye mpa bàfuur kà un'te a ɔlive a boo a bul an'kɔkà amà kàtwey nde ŋakwo?<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɔ̈ɔ̈ a ntsüü a baar a Isàlɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Ntɔn mɛ inkwen anki, atɔŋ, naa bɛ làkɔ̈ɔ̈n ayöb ngyee ayi, manà bɛ làyamɛnà naa bɛ làbà aŋan'yeerà: ndam a baar a Isàlɛl, mpem aba isàkal yàŋàbwà bwoor mbɔɔn tii mpal bàsàbilà baar mpa abà Ayudà banswà uboo a un'sɛŋ a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Apan, Isàlɛl kyanswà isàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈, asànaa bàsön ya naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">« Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ asàtoo u Siyɔnà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">nde asàlwom ube a Yakɔb.<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Ya isàkal nkwà amɛ anà ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:27">mpal in'sàlwom mɛ man'be aba. »<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Ntɔn Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ, ba bà ayiiŋ a Nzam, ntɔn ubwaŋ abɛ, wɛɛ, ntɔn nsɔ̈ɔ̈l a Nzam, ba bànkween ntɔn bànkaa aba. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Ntɔn, Nzam ufàduum anki kab a ngway ufàpà nde, nde ufàsɔɔm anki mbeel ande. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Abun sye, itaan, bɛ Nzam lun'kyeyà anki, apanà, ntɔn unkwem aba, bɛ bàkyàlasyääm, <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>abun, ukɔɔn unkyeey aba apanà kan'kyer naa Nzam kisyääm, anà nde usyääm sye ba banswà. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Ntɔn, Nzam kàbäm baar banswà uboo a unkwem ntɔn musyääm ba banswà.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Ɔɔ, indübà a un'naaŋ, a an'yeerà anà a un'yɛnà a Nzam! Ntsüül a mbar ande ufàgyool anki, mbwo ande ufàkul anki! <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>Asànaa itɛɛnà Ndaa Aŋàsɔn:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">« Nà kàyöb an'kyän a Mwol?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">Itàkal naa nà kan'kwo mukal un'pɛɛl a an'lwɛŋ ande?<verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>Itàkal naa nà kàtun'pà undiir</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:35">waa nde kàfun'lɔ̈ɔ̈m mfüür awa? »<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Ntɔn undiir wanswà afü akà nde, u mbwo a nde, ntɔn nde. Akà nde làkoo a mbul a in'tye! Yà abwɛy.<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Mɔ̈ɔ̈ akün unsà isal a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Atɔŋ, mɛ amàlalɔɔm, kikɔb a nsyääm a Nzam, làkäb ndür abɛ asànaa ibɔɔn a mɔ̈ɔ̈, kyà in'kyɛɛl anà kyàmupà Nzam un'sak: kya isàkal ngyamàkà a ndandaa ntɔn bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Twon lan'lab nsyääl a mɛɛn a mpal ayi, wɛɛ làkäl bàŋàbulà u nsɔɔmà a un'yɛnà ntɔn musà nsɔ̈ɔ̈l unsà ukwen a Nzam: undiir aŋàbwaŋ afàpà nde un'sak anà wàŋàkwo.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>U mbwo a kab a ngway alà ban'pɛ, mɛ in'tɛn akà umwɛy umwɛy uboo a bɛ: twon lan'kal anà uyɔl aŋàsöönà anà uyɔl tii unsà undiir ayɔbà, làyɔbà mbɔɔn ntɔn mutɔn uyɔl, umwɛy ntɔn isii a làkwikilà alà kun'pɛ Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Asànaa bi ibà itiir mbɔɔn unsà ndür mwɛy, wɛɛ itiir abi byanswà kà byà isal imwɛy anki. <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>Kyakin, itàkal naa bi ibà mbɔɔn, bi ibà ndür mwɛy unsà Klistɔ, ntɔn bi ibàŋàtüüb amwɛy anà bumwɛy, asànaa itiir a ndür mwɛy. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Bi ibye anà an'kab mànsöön, mulab kab a ngway alà bipɛ, nkye la là kab a ngɔɔm? Wɛy bàsyääl la unsà un'tüüb anà làkwikilà. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Nà awe anà kab a isal? Wɛy nde upɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande unsà isal. Umwɛy usàkal anà kab alɔŋ, wɛy nde ulɔŋ. <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Nkye wumwɛy we alà làlɛɛl? Wɛy nde ulɛɛl. Wɛy mbuur afàpà, upɛ ukɔɔn asà un'tal, mbuur asyen, ukyer anà un'kanà, mbuur afàsyääm, ukyer unsà un'sak.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Wɛy ukwen abɛ bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n akal bà mpem ywel. Làsi làyiiŋ akà ube, làbääb anà ubwaŋ: <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>- ntɔn ukwen a itɔŋ, làkäl anà ukwen mbɔɔn bɛ a bɛ, - ntɔn ibyääl, làkäl bàtàtwɛb musyäŋà baar asin, <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>- ntɔn isal a Mwol, làkäl ngwal unsà Dweelà, lun'syääl asànaa asɔ, <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>- ntɔn làkyän, làkäl unsà un'sak, - ntɔn mpay, làkäl anà nkääŋ a mpem, làsi muküünà u ngyamàkà <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>- ntɔn ngyal a aŋin'kyɛɛl, labay, làkäl anà un'kaay.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Làsaak baar abà bàfàlamɛɛy nkwaaŋ: lasaak, twon lasi in'küül. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Làsäŋ anà baar abà unsà un'sak, làlel anà baar bàlelà. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Làkäl anà un'tüüb a ngwal bɛ a bɛ: twon lan'kal anà ngyal a indiir an'köl an'köl, wɛɛ, wɛy bàlasyeen akà indiir a làbɔ̈ɔ̈n. Twon lan'kyey uyɔl naa bɛ làbà aŋan'yeerà.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Akà mbuur mwɛy, twon lan'fuur ube kà ikal a ube. Taaŋ lanswà, làleŋ mukyer ubwaŋ kusà a baar banswà. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Kya ipöl isàkal, naa ba ukwen abɛ, làkäl a duu anà baar banswà. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Nkween amɛ, twon lan'fuur bɛ ŋakwo ube akà ube, wɛɛ làwɛy nkyɛl a Nzam isäl, ntɔn bàsön naa: « Mwol kàtɛn naa: "Mfuur a ube yà yàmɛ, mɛ kan'kwo mufur nsyääl a umwɛy umwɛy. <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Wɛɛ isàkal naa un'yiiŋ a ngye we anà ngyal, un'pɛ udyà, isàkal naa nde we anà mfyää, un'pɛ unwà. Ntɔn ngye asàkyer abun, ya yà asànaa an'kal a mbaa ngye akasaa udu a un'tswe ande." » <verse eid="ROM 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Abun, twon an'wɛy naa ube bàwɛl iböŋ udu a ngye, wɛɛ kal wàŋàböŋ kusà a ube mukyer ubwaŋ.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Unkyeey akà abyääl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Wɛy mbuur wanswà ukäl anà unkyeey akà amfum abye anà ikɔ̈b, ntɔn, kà kye anà ikɔ̈b anki ikɔ̈ɔ̈n afà akà Nzam anà kàkɔ̈ɔ̈n asà Nde. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Abun, mbuur afàmbäär ikɔ̈b, nde afàmbäär nswɛɛŋ kàkwen Nzam. Baar bàfàmbäär ya, bàsànaan ntaaŋàmbar udu a ba ŋakwo. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Apan, antɛɛn kà baar awem bɔɔmà anki akà baar bàfàkyer ubwaŋ, wɛɛ akà baar bàfàkyer ube. Nkye ngye akwen mukɔɔn awem ntɛɛn bɔɔmà? Kyer ubwaŋ, waa nde kasyäŋà. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Ntɔn, nde wà un'syääl a Nzam ntɔn mukasiinà mukyer ubwaŋ. Wɛɛ, isàkal naa ngye afàkyer ube, apan, man bɔɔmà! Ntɔn, kà bunàbun anki awà nde anà kɔm mupà ntaaŋàmbar: nde wà un'syääl a Nzam ntɔn muswaŋ nkyɛl ande akà mbuur un'be. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Kyakin, yubwaŋ mukal anà unkyeey, kà nà ntɔn bɔɔmà a nkyɛl mpɛl anki, wɛɛ sye, ntɔn an'kyän.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Kyakin sye làfàfur bɛ iter, ntɔn baar bàfàwal bya, ba bà uboo a isal a Nzam ntɔn mukwey kya ubwaŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Làpɛ akà mbuur mbuur undiir awà ilɔɔmà mukun'pà: itɛr, akà mbuur awal itɛr, ibaa, akà mbuur awal ibaa, bɔɔmà, akà mbuur awal bɔɔmà, làbɔ̈ɔ̈n, akà mbuur awal làbɔ̈ɔ̈n, ibyääl, akà mbuur awal ibyääl.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwen a amwɛy anà bumwɛy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Twon lan'kal anà nkul a mbuur, naa tɛy, nkul abɛ, yà mukwen amwɛy anà bumwɛy. Ntɔn mbuur afàkwen mbuur wumwɛy, nde kan'kwey un'kɔɔn. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Apan, nswɛɛŋ asànaa: « Twon an'tà inswem, twon an'dwa, twon an'yib, twon an'yɔm mpem », anà yumwɛy yanswà, yan'bilà unsà ndaa yi: « Ngye asàkwen un'tɔŋ angye asànaa ngye ŋakwo. » <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Ukwen bàfàkyer anki akà ube mwɛy akà un'tɔŋ. Ukwen, yà mukwey un'kɔɔn wanswà.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ ntɔn ngyeel a Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ muyöb naa bi ibà mpal nà: làwiyà u twaal abɛ. Ntɔn ŋàbawà, ngweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈ yà tsütsü apà bi, akwànaa utaaŋ kàsɛmà bi musà làkwikilà. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Mpib yàbü itaan, mwäänà wà tsütsü. Lalan, bi ipiy isal a làpib, bi ibwaar an'tà a pɛɛlà. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Wɛy bi iyikyà a swalaa, asànaa u mwäänà answà, ukɔɔn in'kyɔm aŋàsöönà anà ngyöör a man, ukɔɔn ndaa a nswɛn anà ipasàsɛ, ukɔɔn an'sye anà un'köl. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Wɛɛ làbwäär Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ, twon lan'pà mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ unsà ndür ntɔn mupà un'sak akà ilään aya.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Ukɔɔn atsüül un'tɔŋ nsaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Lun'wɛl mbuur awe anà gyɔ̈ɔ̈là unsà làkwikilà, twon lan'ler an'kyän ande pànsi pànsi. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Làkwikilà a mbuur mwɛy lun'paa mbwo mudyà undiir wanswà, wɛɛ wumwɛy, u mbwo a gyɔ̈ɔ̈là, afàdyà ndon mpɛl. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Wɛy mbuur afàdyà, ukɔɔn adyà un'siinà mbuur mpa afàdyà anà mbuur mpa afàdyà ukɔɔn atsüül mbuur afàdyà nsaŋ, ntɔn Nzam kàkyun'wal. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Ngye, ngye awà nà mutsüül un'syääl abar nsaŋ? Itàkal naa nde wàŋàtsim, itàkal naa nde wàŋàbwà, ntɔn Mwol we anà ikɔ̈b mukun'mbaar.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Akà mbuur umwɛy, ye anà nsöön uboo a ilä. Akà wumwɛy, bya byanswà byà mfun. Wɛy mbuur mbuur, amu an'kyän ande ŋakwo, ukäl aŋàsà kam. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Mbuur afàsà ilä un'tal, nde afàkyer ntɔn Mwol. Mbuur afàdyà indiir byanswà, nde afàkyer ntɔn Mwol, nde afàfuur an'tɔɔn akà Nzam. Mbuur mpa afàdyà bya byanswà afàfuur an'tɔɔn sye akà Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Kyakin, kà we anà umwey anki uboo a bi afàkal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ntɔn nde mpɛl, kà umwey anki sye afàkwà ntɔn nde ŋakwo. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa bi ibye anà mɔ̈ɔ̈, bi ibà ntɔn Mwol. Isàkal naa bi kan'kwà, bi kan'kwà ntɔn Mwol. Lalan, itàkal naa bi ibye anà mɔ̈ɔ̈, itàkal naa bi kan'kwà, bi ibà ntɔn Mwol. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Lalan, ntɔn mukal Mwol a akü anà wà baar a mɔ̈ɔ̈ waa Klistɔ kàkü anà kàfyefurà u mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Wɛɛ ngye, ntɔn nkye atsüülà ngye un'tɔŋ angye nsaŋ? Abun, bi banswà isàkal kusà a làbay a nsaŋ a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Asànaa kàtɛn Mwol:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">« Mɛ, Mwol in'wà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈, an'kyey naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">baar banswà bàsyebwà an'köm kusà amɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">ba banswà bàsàsyäŋà Nzam. »<verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Abun, mbuur mbuur uboo a bi asàkyer asà un'lɔɔn akà Nzam ntɔn nde ŋakwo.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkɔ̈ɔ̈n abwiy un'tɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Bi ikyer awɛy mutsuul nsaŋ bamwɛy anà bumwey, wɛɛ làkyer naa bɛ làkɔ̈ɔ̈n akal isin a mbweel a un'tɔŋ. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Akà mɛ, mɛ in'kyàyöb, mɛ an'sà kam unsà Mwol Yɛsu naa: undiir a ŋingyäy watɛy. Wɛɛ undiir a ŋingyäy wà akà mbuur awà kan'kyey naa wa wà abun. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Isàkal naa un'tɔŋ angye kan'man ngyɛb ntɔn isaa an'dyà ngye, ngye afàkal anki uboo a ukwen. U mbwo a isaa angye, twon an'bwiy mbuur awà kàkweel Yɛsu. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Wɛy undiir aŋàbwaŋ ntɔn bɛ ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akal ntɔn mutwee bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Ntɔn, Imwol a Nzam kà kyà udyà anà unwà anki, wɛɛ balàbal, duu anà un'sak amu Dweelà In'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Mbuur ufàsyääl Klistɔ abà, asànaa un'sɔ, Nzam akyer afun'kyey, baar bàkyer afun'kwen.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Lalan, bi ilab indiir byàfàpà duu anà indiir byàfàtɔŋ itɔŋ. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Twon an'dwa isal a Nzam ntɔn isaa. Ndandaa, indiir byanswà byàŋàpɔŋà, wɛɛ yà ube mudyà undiir kan'kwo mukal kyà ntɔn un'tɔŋ. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Yubwaŋ mukɔɔn adyà in'twaŋ, itàkal unwà man bàfàyɔr, itàkal undiir asin kan'kwo mubwiy un'tɔŋ angye. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Kaar ntɔn ngye, kusà a Nzam, làkwikilà awà ngye alà. Un'sak akà mbuur mpa afàtsüül nsaŋ nde ŋakwo ntɔn nsɔ̈ɔ̈l ande ufàsyääl nde. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Wɛɛ mbuur akadyaa anà nkyɛɛr, nde wàŋàkwà ndwà, ntɔn nkääl ande kà yan'fà anki u nsyeel a kam ande unsà làkwikilà. Kyekà, undiir wanswà mpa afàfà u nsyeel a kam unsà làkwikilà wà man'be.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Un'sak ntɔn atɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Bi baar ibà ngwal, bi ikyer asɛɛn gyɔ̈ɔ̈là a baar mpa abà ngwal anà mukɔɔn aleŋ ubwaŋ abi ŋakwo. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Wɛy mbuur mbuur uboo a bi uleŋ mupà un'sak akà un'tɔŋ ande ntɔn mukun'bay muyɛl unsà làkwikilà. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Lalan, Klistɔ kàleŋ anki indiir byàpɛɛ nde un'sak, wɛɛ, asànaa bàsön naa: « In'tswe a abweel in'tswe angye myàkyàbwà udu a mɛ. » <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Kyekà, indiir byanswà bàsön kusà byàkäl ntɔn an'lɔɔŋ abi, ntɔn naa, u mbwo a muküünà anà ndɛɛl yàtwääl Ndaa Aŋàsɔn, bi ikäl anà làkyän. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Wɛy Nzam a muküünà anà ndɛɛl, kàlapɛ mukal un'tüüb uboo a bɛ, asànaa ukwen Klistɔ Yɛsu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>ntɔn, u mpem mwɛy anà u mun mwɛy, bɛ làsi làkoo akà Nzam, Taar a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ ntɔn baar banswà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Làkäl anà un'kaay bɛ a bɛ, asànaa Klistɔ kàlawɛl nde, ntɔn làkoo a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Abun, mɛ alàkyään naa, kà ikɔb a lää a Nzam waa Klistɔ kàbulà un'syääl a baar aŋàkyɛy, ntɔn mukwey ilää kàpɛ nde akà bàtaa. <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>Akà baar mpa abà Ayudà, ba bàfàpà Nzam làkoo ntɔn nsyääm ande, asànaa bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">« Kyakin, mɛ in'sasyäŋà uboo a in'sɛŋ a baar mpa abà Ayudà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">mɛ in'sàtɔɔl diim ntɔn ikɔb angye. »<verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Nde kàfàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">« In'sɛŋ a mpa abà Ayudà, làsäŋ anà un'sɛŋ ande! » <verse eid="ROM 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Itàkal sye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">« In'sɛŋ a mpa abà Ayudà, bɛ banswà làsyäŋà Mwol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">in'sɛŋ myanswà lun'syäŋà! »<verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Yɛsay kàfàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">« Kà itoo a Zesɛ, mbuur akyer asàyà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">nde akyer asàmbarà ntɔn muyaal in'sɛŋ a baar mpa abà Ayudà.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Baar mpa abà Ayudà bàsàsà làkyän amu nde. »<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Wɛy Nzam a làkyän kàlayööl a un'sak wanswà anà duu unsà làkwikilà, ntɔn bɛ làkäl anà làkyän aŋàsöönà u ngwal a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl!<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɔl we anà ikɔ̈b musɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Ntɔn bɛ, atɔŋ amɛ, mɛ an'kyey ndandaa naa bɛ làbà bɛ ŋakwo làŋàyɔl a ubwaŋ, làŋàyɔl a un'yɛnà wanswà anà lan'kwo mupà an'lwɛŋ bɛ a bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Apan, ntɔn mufàbay an'kyän abɛ mbaa, mɛ amàlasöön anà unkir kà ikal byumwɛy, ntɔn kab a ngway kan'pɛ Nzam <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>mukal un'syääl a Yɛsu Klistɔ apà baar mpa abà Ayudà, mupà mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ wanswà kà isal a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ là Nzam, ntɔn naa baar mpa abà Ayudà bàbulà an'kab kàkyey Nzam, màŋàkyɛɛl amu Dweelà In'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Lalan, mɛ in'we anà ngaal amɛ amu Klistɔ Yɛsu ntɔn isal a Nzam. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Ntɔn, isàkal naa mɛ in'we anà undiir atɛn, mɛ in'tɛn nà indiir kàkyer Klistɔ u mbwo amɛ ntɔn musyen baar mpa abà Ayudà kà unkyeey: amu ndaa anà amu isal, <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>unsà ngwal a idiim anà impà, unsà ngwal a Dweelà a Nzam. Apan, sɛmà Yɛlusàlɛm anà ikal a tsütsü tii u Iliri, mɛ kàkyään aŋàkwo Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ là Klistɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Wɛɛ mɛ kàsi ibyääl mukyään Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ nà kà ikal mpa bàkäl aŋàtàtà ikɔb a Klistɔ din, ntɔn mukɔɔn atɔŋ udu a in'bään kàsi mbuur asin. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Kyakin mɛ in'lab ndaa bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">« Baar mpa bakyään ntɔn Nde, bàkyer asàman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">ba akwà mpa bàkäl aŋàtàwem musam ntɔn Nde, bàkyer asàyöb. »<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɔl wàmuyöŋà mukyà Lɔmà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Undiir nsil awun kan'tsüŋà mbalà mbɔɔn muyà akà bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Wɛɛ apan, mɛ in'fàkal anki anà ikal asal ntsü ayi akà, anà, sɛmà mbul mbɔɔn, mɛ in'we anà ngyal mbɔɔn muyà akà bɛ, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>umpal in'yàkyà mɛ Ɛspanye. Mɛ an'sà làkyän muyàlaler utaaŋ in'yàlyaaŋ mɛ anà bɛ mukan'bay mukyà kwo, ungö atàyɔl a un'sak, itàkal ikikye, mukal anà bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Wɛɛ apanà, mɛ in'wàmukyà Yɛlusàlɛm ntɔn musyääl aŋin'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Ntɔn, Masɛdwan anà Akayi bàtsül mbar muköŋà indiir, ntɔn mubay aŋàlàmbwà abà uboo a aŋikyɛɛl a Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Inye, ba ŋakwo bàtsül abun, wɛɛ, kutɛn aŋàbwaŋ ba bàlàkyer abun. Ntɔn, isàkal naa baar mpa abà Ayudà bàwɛl kab unsà indiir in'kyɛɛl aba, ba sye bàkyer afasyääl unsà indiir a ngyal aba. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Umpal in'sàkal mɛ aŋàmay anà aŋàpà kà imɛɛy indiir ban'bwiy, mɛ in'yàkyà Ɛspanye, muyàlyaaŋ apà bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Mɛ in'kyàyöb naa muyà akà bɛ, mɛ in'yàyà aŋàyɔl a nsaak a Klistɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Mɛ in'lɔm akà bɛ, atɔŋ, akà Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ anà u mbwo a ukwen a Dweelà, munwan un'tüüb anà mɛ u mbwo a ngyamàkà làsaa bɛ akà Nzam ntɔn mɛ, <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>ntɔn mɛ in'kɔ̈ɔ̈n akwɛlà akà baar a Yuday bà mpem bwoor bà, ntɔn mbaay in'syen mɛ u Yɛlusàlɛm, aŋikyɛɛl bàwɛl ya ubwaŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Abun, mɛ in'yàkɔlà apà bɛ unsà un'sak, kà ukwen a Nzam, anà muyöör anà bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Wɛy Nzam a duu ukäl anà bɛ banswà! Yà abwɛy!<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr abɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Mɛ amàlatööm Fɔ̈bɛ, mpääŋ abi, un'syääl a ndwà a Nzam ayà u Sanshrɛs. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Lun'wɛl unsà Mwol, asànaa yan'kwo ya akà aŋin'kyɛɛl, lun'bay unsà ndaa yanswà uyàkal nde anà mfun abɛ. Ntɔn nde kàkäl un'yee a baar mbɔɔn anà wà mɛ ŋakwo.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Lapɛ Priskà anà Akila mbɔr, mbaay amɛ unsà isal a Yɛsu Klistɔ, <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>ba bàkyer alàkwà ntɔn mukan'tswà mɔ̈ɔ̈. Kà mɛ mpɛl anki kàfuur an'tɔɔn, wɛɛ sye Ikööŋ a baar mpa abà Ayudà. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Làpɛ sye Ikööŋ byanswà ifàköŋ u ndwà aba mbɔr. Lun'pɛ nkween amɛ Ɛpɛnɛt mbɔr, mbɛŋ atàtwɛb yà Azi ntɔn Klistɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Lun'pɛ Màlye mbɔr, nde kàsäl mbɔɔn ntɔn bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Lapɛ Andrɔnikis anà Yunyas mbɔr, aböör amɛ anà mbaay amɛ yà bɔlokà. Ba bà abyääl uboo a antööm, ba sye bàkäl amu Klistɔ kusà amɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Lun'pɛ Ampilayatus mbɔr, mbuur amɛ wàntal uboo a Mwol. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Lun'pɛ Lubɛn mbɔr, un'baay abi amu Klistɔ anà nkween amɛ Stakis. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Lun'pɛ Apɛlɛ mbɔr, mbuur kàswɛŋ inääm ande amu Klistɔ. Lapɛ baar abà u ndwà a Aristɔbul mbɔr. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Lun'pɛ un'böör amɛ Erɔdyɔn mbɔr. Lapɛ baar abà u ndwà a Narsis abà uboo a Mwol mbɔr. <verse eid="ROM 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Lapɛ Trifɛn anà Trifɔs mbɔr, ba bàmɛn mpay ntɔn Mwol. Lun'pɛ nkween Pɛrsis mbɔr, nde kàdwä ndür unsà isal a Mwol. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Lun'pɛ Rufus mbɔr, awà bàsɔ̈ɔ̈l amu Mwol anà ngwän ande awà wàmɛ sye. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Làpɛ Asynkrit, Felɛgɔn, Ermɛs, Patrɔbas, Ermas, anà atɔŋ abà anà ba mbɔr. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Làpɛ Filɔlɔke anà Zuli, Nɛrɛ anà mpääŋ ande, Ɔlympas anà aŋin'kyɛɛl abà anà ba mbɔr.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Làpɛɛlà mbɔr a ndüür in'kyɛɛl bamwɛy anà bumwɛy. Ikööŋ byanswà byà Klistɔ byàmàlapà mbɔr.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndɛɛl a ntsüü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Mɛ amàlalɔɔm, atɔŋ, mukal kà igyɛɛŋ akà baar bàfàtwaal nkaabà anà bàfàbwiy aŋàlàkwikilà ndwaŋ mutɔn an'lɔɔŋ amà làwɛl bɛ. Làkäl u kwɛl an à ba. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Ntɔn baar aban bàfàsyääl anki Klistɔ, Mwol abi, wɛɛ an'bäl aba, anà, unsà ndaa aba yà ntsà anà an'yääm aba mà loor, màfàkur baar a làbɔ̈ɔ̈n. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Baar banswà bàkyàyöb unkyeey abɛ. Lalan mɛ in'wà unsà un'sak ntɔn bɛ, wɛɛ mɛ in'kwen naa bɛ làkäl aŋan'yeerà ntɔn ubwaŋ anà ankɔr ntɔn ube. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Yan'sal ikikye, Nzam a duu ayàbwanà Satanà ungyɛl a in'kɔl abɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Wɛy kab a ngway a Mwol abi Yɛsu làkäl anà bɛ!<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Tumàtɛ, un'baay amɛ, kàmàlapà mbɔr, anà Lusyus, Yasɔn anà Sɔsipatrɔs, aböör amɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Mɛ Tɛrtyus in'sɔnà un'kaan wà, mɛ amàlatööm mbɔr unsà Mwol.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Gäyus, mbuur kan'wɛl, anà Ikööŋ kyanswà ifàköŋ u ndwà ande kàmàlapà mbɔr. Erast, mbuur afàkaar ngim a bul lanswà kàmalapà mbɔr, anà un'tɔŋ Kartus.<verse eid="ROM 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Wɛy kab a ngway a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ làkäl anà bɛ banswà! Wöwö!<verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làkoo là ntɔn Nzam mpɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Bi isyäŋà Nzam! Nde we anà ikɔ̈b mukàlapà ngwal asànaa làlɔɔmà Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ in'fàkyään mɛ ntɔn Yɛsu Klistɔ, mulab ngyööb kàwɛl bi u ngyööŋ aŋàyee a Nzam. Ngyööŋ ayi yàkäl yàŋàyee itaan, taaŋ mbɔɔn, <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>wɛɛ apanà, ya bàkyàmɛɛy u pɛɛlà anà u ngyööb a baar mpa abà Ayudà u mbwo a in'kaan a aŋangɔɔm anà mulab nswɛɛŋ a Nzam ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ntsüü. Ya bàkyàswaŋ akà in'sɛŋ myanswà, ntɔn mya myàsi làkwikilà amu Nde anà myun'syääl.<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Wɛy làkoo làkäl akà Nzam awà Nde mpɛl ŋan'yeerà, u mbwo a Yɛsu Klistɔ, u mbul a in'tye! Wöwö!<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
